# bench-mesh builds use the repo root as build context (compose.yaml:
# `context: ..`). Without this file the context is the WHOLE repo —
# observed 9.5 GB and ~7 minutes of "transferring context" PER SERVICE
# once target/ regrows, and a week of that ballooned the BuildKit state
# volume to 174 GB. The image build needs sources and manifests only.
target/
.git/
.claude/
bench-mesh/results/
docs/
evidence/
*.log
